  "details": "I and perhaps a number of individuals have considerably shaky hands, which makes certain actions difficult in VRChat. This is made more evident in competitive VRChat games (aiming with shaky hands), and it becomes sometimes a nightmare to operate in-world menus and items without missing. Angular motion smoothing would really do well for when you are aiming at UI, objects, or are holding objects in VRChat.",
